te good start hunting place for any vocation and for <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladins</a> even better, because they can hunt with the spears dropped by trolls. There is also a little <a href=\"#/quest/troll-cave-quest\">quest</a> in this cave.\n<br/>\nIn the second level underground, southwest, there is a small room that seems to be dedicated to Goblins's worship. There is a Goblin statue in the middle of it, and rubbish all around. Northwest, there is a room with some fishes on the ground; possibly, they are preys of the bears that live there.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" style=\"width: 200px\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> <img alt=\"Goblin worship\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"217\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/GoblinWorshipEdronTrollCave_9c214a.jpg\" width=\"200\"/>  <figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> <svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg> <p class=\"caption\">Goblin worship</p> </figcaption> </figure>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>First level creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Troll\"><img alt=\"Troll\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Troll_b18126.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Troll\">Troll</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">20</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">50</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">15 <span class=\"icon\">